parity/goldens

# Probe forward-outputs (`--dit25-probe`): literal forward-outputs of the LTX-2 weights, i.e. the
# same weight-derivative class as parity/goldens/ — never committed (license §3 habit).
# The .out logs and the .md summaries beside them are OURS and DO get committed.
probes/**/*.safetensors
